1.0.3 2026-10-30
  - Units: channels.tsv units µV -> n/a: the release gives no unit for the P-File field 'raw' (the µV came from the authors'
    figure axis labels); the converter writes n/a in channels.tsv and the BrainVision headers, and the 84 headers say n/a,
    committed as plain git text files (were annexed; .eeg files unchanged). The per-electrode P-File voltageCalib (unit
    not documented, not applied) is listed in the channel descriptions. New README section 'Corrections (version 1.0.3)'
    (units, voltageCalib, trace mean/std ranges from the receipt in code/receipts, ADC grid, float32 rounding); the
    Contents lines it corrects are kept as published. GeneratedBy: converter description and Version (2026-10-30).

